{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow an <strong>epic high fantasy story</strong> as you and your companions <strong>explore a world</strong>\u00a0filled with quests and challenges that takes around <strong>20-30 hours</strong> to complete.<br><br>This game is <strong>not an auto-battler, nor is it a turn based tactics game</strong>. It's something in-between. But it is also a visual novel, where you follow quests and adventures and make choices.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/MeteorSpellGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your party will go on <strong>adventures</strong>, fight <strong>battles</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong> to complete detailed and diverse quests, with a large variety of enemies. Each adventure is unique, but can be played a few different ways to give replayablility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alot of the gameplay revolves arounds <strong>Guilds</strong> and the players reputation with them. Complete quests and sell loot to the guilds to gain reputation so to buy legendary weapons and hire new characters for your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/QuestGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero class has <strong>5 different abilities</strong> in the game and there are a <strong>12 classes of hero </strong>in the game. With a planned total of at least <strong>25 characters </strong>to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However the player, as the leader of the party, is different. He uses his skills to buff his companions; and uses magic to cast elemental <strong>spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/RegionGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up</strong> your characters <strong>constellation skill tree</strong> to increase their capability in combat and learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase </strong>new equipment, gain it as <strong>loot </strong>from battles, or <strong>craft </strong>it, to improve the stats of your heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/LevelUpGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Please Wishlist - Coming Soon!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/6bcdcea93f35384687a8200ce7a4f26ff5312691.jpg"},{"name":"And he lived happily ever after","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/a4bafb8cad63f1eb4a3cd0ab50ef456c3fe91c4e.jpg"},{"name":"And they lived happily ever after","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/a4bafb8cad63f1eb4a3cd0ab50ef456c3fe91c4e.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/6bcdcea93f35384687a8200ce7a4f26ff5312691.jpg"},{"name":"Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/6bcdcea93f35384687a8200ce7a4f26ff5312691.jpg"},{"name":"True Chaotic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/6bcdcea93f35384687a8200ce7a4f26ff5312691.jpg"},{"name":"True Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/6bcdcea93f35384687a8200ce7a4f26ff5312691.jpg"},{"name":"Monophemus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/237929671a4cd6a06c357e1bea1adc594d87ae97.jpg"},{"name":"Madness in the Mela","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/237929671a4cd6a06c357e1bea1adc594d87ae97.jpg"},{"name":"Lady Beale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043430/237929671a4cd6a06c357e1bea1adc594d87ae97.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3043430?t=1743166966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743166966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743166966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743166966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There are certain character designs with revealing outfits. There are moments in cutscenes during game when some characters may be portrayed as naked, but no actual explicit content is shown. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow an <strong>epic high fantasy story</strong> as you and your companions <strong>explore a world</strong>\u00a0filled with quests and challenges that takes around <strong>20-30 hours</strong> to complete.<br><br>This game is <strong>not an auto-battler, nor is it a turn based tactics game</strong>. It's something in-between. But it is also a visual novel, where you follow quests and adventures and make choices.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/MeteorSpellGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your party will go on <strong>adventures</strong>, fight <strong>battles</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong> to complete detailed and diverse quests, with a large variety of enemies. Each adventure is unique, but can be played a few different ways to give replayablility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alot of the gameplay revolves arounds <strong>Guilds</strong> and the players reputation with them. Complete quests and sell loot to the guilds to gain reputation so to buy legendary weapons and hire new characters for your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/QuestGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero class has <strong>5 different abilities</strong> in the game and there are a <strong>12 classes of hero </strong>in the game. With a planned total of at least <strong>25 characters </strong>to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However the player, as the leader of the party, is different. He uses his skills to buff his companions; and uses magic to cast elemental <strong>spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043430/extras/RegionGif.gif?t=1743166966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up</strong> your characters <strong>constellation skill tree</strong> to increase their capability in combat and learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase </strong>new equipment, gain it as <strong>loot </strong>from battles, or <strong>craft </strong>it, to improve the stats of your heroes. </p><p clas